I'm gonna plant.

214
00:10:09,176 --> 00:10:12,877
That's a baby monitor, Frank.
You're planting a baby monitor?

215
00:10:12,879 --> 00:10:18,083
Yeah. A lot of people
are bugging their babies
these days.

216
00:10:18,085 --> 00:10:19,718
I guess babies
can't be trusted.

217
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:23,955
