is banging dudes.

220
00:10:28,328 --> 00:10:30,829
Why would that be shady?

221
00:10:30,831 --> 00:10:32,697
Maybe the dudes are babies.
What?

222
00:10:32,699 --> 00:10:34,332
Bruce is not banging
any baby dudes.

223
00:10:34,334 --> 00:10:35,967
Look, we're going back
to the original plan, okay?

224
00:10:35,969 --> 00:10:38,970
We're gonna put the frame
on him, we're gonna be heroes
among the community,

225
00:10:38,972 --> 00:10:42,374
and I'm gonna get all of my
money back as a reward.
All my money.

226
00:10:42,376 --> 00:10:45,377
Well, whatever.
It was probably gonna
end up mine eventually, so--

227
00:10:45,379 --> 00:10:49,648
Okay. There's something
I want to talk to you about.

228
00:10:49,650 --> 00:10:52,884
Were you planning on offing me,

229
00:10:52,886 --> 00:10:55,253
and then offing Dennis also?

230
00:10:55,255 --> 00:10:56,588
Frank, we are in
the middle of something.

231
00:10:56,590 --> 00:10:58,890
I don't have time to chitchat
with you about stuff right now.

232
00:10:58,892 --> 00:11:01,159
Were you planning on offing me?
I didn't say that.

233
00:11:01,161 --> 00:11:03,161
You didn't deny it either.

234
00:11:03,163 --> 00:11:07,932
Uh, deny it?
Do I have to deny
something so crazy?

235
00:11:07,934 --> 00:11:11,236
Give me the baby monitor.
I'll hide it for you.

236
00:11:16,776 --> 00:11:19,344
Capitalism at work.
This oughta show
the son of a bitch.

237
00:11:19,346 --> 00:11:21,279
All right, buddy,
now explain to me
how exactly...

238
00:11:21,281 --> 00:11:23,982
we're gonna
calculate the totals.
Oh, it's easy, dude.

239
00:11:23,984 --> 00:11:26,785
You pour gas into
the car using one of
these funnels, right?

240
00:11:26,787 --> 00:11:28,720
And I count how much gas
is going into the car.

241
00:11:28,722 --> 00:11:30,855
All right, let me--
Let me just stop you
right there.

242
00:11:30,857 --> 00:11:34,325
How exactly are you planning
on counting a liquid?

243
00:11:34,327 --> 00:11:36,061
Uh, I know how
to count, dude.
I'm not--

244
00:11:36,063 --> 00:11:37,929
Okay, you do it.
You do it, Mac.
Because I can't speak to him.

245
00:11:37,931 --> 00:11:41,199
Well, say free market 101--
You gotta have customers to
have a working business, right?

246
00:11:41,201 --> 00:11:47,072
So we gotta attract attention.
I for one suggest me blowing
fireballs to get that attention.

247
00:11:47,074 --> 00:11:49,274
Fireball-- Where is that
coming from? No.

248
00:11:49,276 --> 00:11:51,943
We're not blowing fireballs
around 10 containers of--

249
00:11:51,945 --> 00:11:53,111
People will see it
from the street.

250
00:11:53,113 --> 00:11:54,179
We have 10 containers
of gasoline.

251
00:11:54,181 --> 00:11:56,081
The lighter, please.
What the hell are you--

252
00:11:56,083 --> 00:11:57,348
Thank you, sir.
Let me please reiterate--

253
00:11:57,350 --> 00:11:58,817
He understands.
my strong opposition--

254
00:11:58,819 --> 00:12:00,385
Trust me, Dennis.
I know what I'm doing.
to this idea.

255
00:12:00,387 --> 00:12:03,788
This is really unsafe, dude.
Do not blow that fireball.

256
00:12:03,790 --> 00:12:05,924
Whoa!

257
00:12:06,792 --> 00:12:07,959
Wow. Okay, wow.

258
00:12:07,961 --> 00:12:10,128
I take back everything
I just said. That was amazing.
Oh, dude.

259
00:12:10,130 --> 00:12:11,796
I'm doing
one of those, baby.
I can do it bigger.

260
00:12:11,798 --> 00:12:12,964
You can do it bigger?
No, Charlie.
Let me do it.

261
00:12:12,966 --> 00:12:15,934
Make sure it's bigger.
If you're gonna do it,
make sure you-- Wait.

262
00:12:15,936 --> 00:12:16,835
Aaah!
Whoa.

263
00:12:16,837 --> 00:12:18,937
Oh, goddamn it.
Whoo!

264
00:12:18,939 --> 00:12:20,872
You burned my head.
[ Laughing ]

265
00:12:20,874 --> 00:12:21,940
Oh, I think I burned him.
Really?

266
00:12:21,942 --> 00:12:25,410
Ow! Ow! Jesus Christ.
Easy, camper. Easy, camper.

267
00:12:25,412 --> 00:12:27,779
Relax.
You're gonna feel better.
How can I relax?

268
00:12:27,781 --> 00:12:29,280
Just stop. Just stop.
Okay.

269
00:12:29,282 --> 00:12:32,016
Do you have anything
other than a towel
and duct tape?

270
00:12:32,018 --> 00:12:35,820
Not really.
New plan.
We're going to a hospital.

271
00:12:35,822 --> 00:12:36,821
Oh, whoa. Actually, bro,
you know what?

272
00:12:36,823 --> 00:12:38,523
I think we're gonna
be done with your plans
for a little while.

273
00:12:38,525 --> 00:12:40,425
Because the system you set up--
It ain't working.

274
00:12:40,427 --> 00:12:43,128
So I got a new system.
Me-- Both the brains
and the looks.

275
00:12:43,130 --> 00:12:46,965
Charlie, you're still gonna be
the wild card, 'cause that
fireball you blew was badass.

276
00:12:46,967 --> 00:12:48,933
It was great, right?
You just kinda got in the way.
Yeah.

277
00:12:48,935 --> 00:12:52,337
Mac, check this out though.
You're gonna be the muscle.
No. I--

278
00:12:52,339 --> 00:12:55,240
I think we gotta stick to
the paradigm that we've set up--

279
00:12:55,242 --> 00:12:56,841
The A-Team, Scooby-Doo--
No, no, no.

280
00:12:56,843 --> 00:13:00,111
Your "paragon"
is failing us, man.
It's a "paradigm," but yeah.

281
00:13:00,113 --> 00:13:01,880
- It wasn't working.
- It's not working.

282
00:13:01,882 --> 00:13:04,816
What happened was we
confused your bossiness
with braininess,

283
00:13:04,818 --> 00:13:06,484
and those two are
very different things.
Mm-hmm.

284
00:13:06,486 --> 00:13:08,586
That is what happened.
So check it out
though, man.

285
00:13:08,588 --> 00:13:11,356
I got a new plan.
This is what we're gonna do.
Yeah.

286
00:13:11,358 --> 00:13:12,991
Yeah. We're gonna steal
Frank's rape van--
Mm-hmm.

287
00:13:12,993 --> 00:13:16,361
