all that gasoline is ruining
the interior of my car.

288
00:13:16,363 --> 00:13:17,929
And I just--
I won't have it.
No.

289
00:13:17,931 --> 00:13:20,265
Then we're gonna take
that van and we're
gonna offer people...

290
00:13:20,267 --> 00:13:22,333
