I'd say it's about 195 yards.

304
00:14:03,543 --> 00:14:06,110
He has a seven iron.

305
00:14:06,946 --> 00:14:07,979
[ Sharp Smack ]

306
00:14:07,981 --> 00:14:10,849
I mean, how has he been
sitting there watching golf
for three hours?

307
00:14:10,851 --> 00:14:14,352
I don't know. I don't know.
[ Man ]
Is that a baby monitor?

308
00:14:14,354 --> 00:14:15,987
Oh! Shit. Cut it off.

309
00:14:15,989 --> 00:14:18,456
Goddamn it.
Now he's suspicious of us.
Oh, no.

310
00:14:18,458 --> 00:14:20,124
Oh, no.
You are such a bad hider.

311
00:14:20,126 --> 00:14:21,492
I'm a bad hider?
You never could hide.

312
00:14:21,494 --> 00:14:25,029
It was hard to--
I bet you still hide your money
