313
00:14:25,031 --> 00:14:27,699
[ Scoffs ]
My sock drawer?

314
00:14:27,701 --> 00:14:29,500
Yeah.
Come on.
That would be stupid.

315
00:14:29,502 --> 00:14:30,568
Yeah, you do.
You're lying to me.

316
00:14:30,570 --> 00:14:31,970
Just shut up.
I'm not lying to you.

317
00:14:31,972 --> 00:14:33,638
I'm getting outta here.
This is a setup.
Will you relax?

318
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:35,473
You're setting me up,
and I'm getting the hell out.

319
00:14:35,475 --> 00:14:38,977
Frank, get back here.
You're not gonna
do this to me, girl.

320
00:14:38,979 --> 00:14:41,546
I understand
what's goin' on.
Come back, Frank. Goddamn it.

321
00:14:41,548 --> 00:14:43,581
- Okay, they're on the move.
- I know what's going on.

322
00:14:43,583 --> 00:14:45,183
You think I was
born yesterday?
Hey, you son of a bitch.

323
00:14:45,185 --> 00:14:47,952
Okay, go. Go, Mac. Go. Go.
[ Dee ]
What are you talking about?

324
00:14:47,954 --> 00:14:52,223
Don't lie to me. I have my ways
of finding out things.
You'll be sor--

325
00:14:52,225 --> 00:14:57,962
Oh, my God.
Is that a Muslim guy?
He's getting in my van.

326
00:14:57,964 --> 00:15:00,465
[ Tires Squealing ]

327
00:15:01,333 --> 00:15:03,368
- Oh, shit!
- [ Groans ]

328
00:15:03,370 --> 00:15:06,371
