333
00:15:30,997 --> 00:15:32,263
I'm not gonna talk
in a Southern accent.

334
00:15:32,265 --> 00:15:34,032
It's bad enough
that you wore
this stupid disguise.

335
00:15:34,034 --> 00:15:35,266
But we're oilmen.
We would have Southern accents.

336
00:15:35,268 --> 00:15:39,237
- We don't need bolo ties
