- Yes, we do. She's gonna--

337
00:15:39,239 --> 00:15:39,671
Hello, ma'am.

338
00:15:39,673 --> 00:15:42,006
Oh, what a lovely house dress.
[ Exaggerated Southern Accent ]
Yeah.

339
00:15:42,008 --> 00:15:46,377
Well, you're looking
all sorts of good.
Now, you seem like...

340
00:15:46,379 --> 00:15:49,414
