nice, busy, young lady,

341
00:15:49,416 --> 00:15:51,582
so we're not gonna
waste your time today.
Nah.

342
00:15:51,584 --> 00:15:54,052
We're just a couple oilmen
in from Dallas,

343
00:15:54,054 --> 00:15:59,390
