to offer your community
a much-needed service--

346
00:16:07,033 --> 00:16:09,200
Hells, yeah.
We want to fill you up,

347
00:16:09,202 --> 00:16:12,603
if'n you are so inclined
as to let us.

348
00:16:12,605 --> 00:16:14,238
Please let me
do the talking.
I got it.

349
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:17,608
Please let me--
Now we ain't gonna take no
for an answer now, you hear?

350
00:16:17,610 --> 00:16:22,447
Okay? So don't be making me
sic my associate on you
here, all right?

351
00:16:22,449 --> 00:16:26,451
