367
00:17:06,593 --> 00:17:08,226
Admit it. Come on.
[ Gasps ]

368
00:17:08,228 --> 00:17:11,262
Oh, my God.
I don't know what
you're talking about.

369
00:17:11,264 --> 00:17:13,264
Oh, don't lie to me.
No! Okay!

370
00:17:13,266 --> 00:17:14,766
Admit it!
Okay! Okay, I admit it.

371
00:17:14,768 --> 00:17:16,768
