are working for him.
Yes. I work for him.

374
00:17:22,509 --> 00:17:25,410
We get our information
from the top.
The top cave.

375
00:17:25,412 --> 00:17:28,646
Don't bullshit me.
That's all I got to say.

376
00:17:28,648 --> 00:17:29,781
Oh, hey.

377
00:17:29,783 --> 00:17:32,216
I like what
I'm seeing here, Frank.
Bring me up to speed.

378
00:17:32,218 --> 00:17:36,354
I'm waterboarding your sister
because she's escalating
the plot to kill us.

379
00:17:36,356 --> 00:17:39,157
