- Why the hell
would I help you, Dee?

380
00:17:39,159 --> 00:17:41,826
- You're still plotting
to kill me?
- No. Help!

381
00:17:41,828 --> 00:17:43,561
Shut up. Shut up.
Shut up.

382
00:17:43,563 --> 00:17:45,430
Yeah, shut up.
Tell me what's going on.

383
00:17:45,432 --> 00:17:48,066
Hey, Frank, by the way,
