I thought
it was some Muslim guy.
No, not really.

388
00:17:56,743 --> 00:18:00,812
Whoa! What is
going on in here?
Well, Frank's waterboarding Dee.

389
00:18:00,814 --> 00:18:02,380
You guys? You took the van?

390
00:18:02,382 --> 00:18:06,350
Well, hell, yeah.
Oh, my God.
I just realized something.

391
00:18:06,352 --> 00:18:08,820
