396
00:18:20,800 --> 00:18:23,534
Well, what's Dee?
She's the useless chick.

397
00:18:23,536 --> 00:18:24,969
Ahh!Ahh!
Yeah.

398
00:18:24,971 --> 00:18:26,737
Yeah.Yeah.
You see? We complete it.

399
00:18:26,739 --> 00:18:28,606
We all complete the team.

400
00:18:28,608 --> 00:18:32,176
