405
00:18:39,519 --> 00:18:42,220
Well, then it works.
Ha, ha! All right.

406
00:18:42,222 --> 00:18:45,523
Then, gentlemen,
I got a new plan.

407
00:18:46,358 --> 00:18:50,828
♪♪ [ Ghostbusters Theme ]
[ Tires Squeal ]

408
00:18:51,296 --> 00:18:54,165
Okay, now, once we get
to Bruce's, we slip in
