419
00:19:13,520 --> 00:19:15,920
Charlie and I will use that
reward money to pay off
our electricity bill.

420
00:19:15,922 --> 00:19:19,790
Then we'll probably buy some
more gasoline because I feel
like that's a great plan.

421
00:19:19,792 --> 00:19:21,259
- [ Pumping ]
- Wait.

422
00:19:21,261 --> 00:19:23,694
Brakes don't--
Brakes don't work.
The gas pedal--

423
00:19:23,696 --> 00:19:25,363
- No. I'm saying--
No. The brakes--
- Wiggle the gas pedal.

424
00:19:25,365 --> 00:19:28,733
