the brakes working?
- Because I cut the brakes.

425
00:19:28,735 --> 00:19:32,937
Wild card, bitches!
Yee-haw.

426
00:19:32,939 --> 00:19:34,639
What?
Holy shit.

427
00:19:34,641 --> 00:19:36,674
- Oh, God.
- Oh, my God.

428
00:19:36,676 --> 00:19:38,509
Jesus Christ, guys.
I can't stop this van.

429
00:19:38,511 --> 00:19:41,612
Seriously?
Abort.
Abort. Abort!

430
00:19:41,614 --> 00:19:42,246
Go!

431
00:19:42,248 --> 00:19:44,582
[ Man On TV ]
Mastersfield steps up
to the tee,

432
