Aaah!

435
00:19:51,691 --> 00:19:55,760
[ Groaning ]
[ Car Alarms Blaring ]

436
00:19:59,665 --> 00:20:01,632
[ Car Alarms Continue ]

437
00:20:01,634 --> 00:20:04,936
Oh, goddamn it.
What the hell, man?

438
00:20:05,837 --> 00:20:08,739
[ Frank ]
Aw, my van.

439
00:20:09,208 --> 00:20:13,277
Why is someone
trying to ruin my life?

440
00:20:13,279 --> 00:20:15,379
I didn't do anything
to anybody, man.

441
00:20:15,381 --> 00:20:17,415
I love that car.
That, uh--

442
00:20:17,417 --> 00:20:20,651
I love that car, man.
That's not Bruce, is it?

443
00:20:20,653 --> 00:20:24,655
- Nope.
- [ Moaning ]

444
00:20:25,190 --> 00:20:27,425
[ Man ]
♪ When there's
something strange ♪

445
00:20:27,427 --> 00:20:29,393
♪ In your neighborhood ♪

446
