449
00:20:37,503 --> 00:20:41,973
♪ Who you gonna call ♪
♪ Ghostbusters ♪♪

450
00:20:41,975 --> 00:20:45,543
♪♪ [ Synthesizer Plays ]

451
00:20:48,380 --> 00:20:51,649
I ain't 'fraid
of no ghost.

